# Startup identity is emitted once; repeated UCI handshakes do not reset state.
@phase 1.2
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< uci
> id name Manta {{VERSION}}
> id author Miloslav Macurek
> {{OPTION_DECLARATIONS}}
> uciok
< uci
> id name Manta {{VERSION}}
> id author Miloslav Macurek
> {{OPTION_DECLARATIONS}}
> uciok
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
